# (build 165) The Japanese cartridge's text in a message window and a
# list: lang_shop's store in JAPANESE (docs/languages.md). Its face is the
# cartridge's own font, a code's letter and above it its dakuten, eight
# pixels a glyph; the store's list and the party's names -- ユーシス, ネイ,
# the defaults the language changed to -- in it too. 0602's {item} is the
# fourth item's Japanese name.
start building 5 13 5 18
language ja
wait idle
press down
press down
press down
press c
wait idle
expect script $0602
expect text "ラコニアスライサーだね。 だれが もつんだ?"
expect pixel 100 190 $EEE      # the dakuten over だ, in the line's upper
                               # row (paper in a stock line)
shot 01_shop
